abstract: >-
  Evaluation code and the three pre-registered experiments of the OntoOps
  pipeline, which turns a document into competency questions and then into a
  validated OWL TBox. The evaluation code runs the published pipeline services on a
  Docker Compose stack, exports their output to files and scores the files.
license: Apache-2.0
